{"seq":2,"slug":"embassy-async-embedded","title":"Embassy 异步嵌入式框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/embedded/embassy-async-embedded","wordCount":703,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"embassy-异步嵌入式框架\">Embassy 异步嵌入式框架</h1><p>Embassy 是 2026 年嵌入式 Rust 的事实标准异步框架。它在没有操作系统、没有堆分配的裸机环境中实现了完整的 async/await 支持——任务在编译期被转换为状态机，由中断驱动的执行器协作调度。与传统 RTOS 相比，Embassy 消除了上下文切换开销和每任务独立栈的内存浪费，同时保持了 Rust 的内存安全保证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Embassy 的执行器将 async 任务编译为静态分配的状态机。任务不需要独立的栈——它们共享一个栈，通过 await 点协作让出。当没有任务就绪时，执行器自动将 CPU 切入低功耗休眠模式，由硬件中断唤醒。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Embassy Executor] --&gt;|调度| B[Task 1: LED 闪烁]&#10;    A --&gt;|调度| C[Task 2: UART 接收]&#10;    A --&gt;|调度| D[Task 3: 传感器采样]&#10;    E[硬件中断] --&gt;|唤醒 Waker| A&#10;    F[Timer 到期] --&gt;|唤醒 Waker| A&#10;    A --&gt;|无就绪任务| G[WFI 低功耗休眠]&#10;    H[static 分配] --&gt; B&#10;    H --&gt; C&#10;    H --&gt; D\">graph TD\n    A[Embassy Executor] --&gt;|调度| B[Task 1: LED 闪烁]\n    A --&gt;|调度| C[Task 2: UART 接收]\n    A --&gt;|调度| D[Task 3: 传感器采样]\n    E[硬件中断] --&gt;|唤醒 Waker| A\n    F[Timer 到期] --&gt;|唤醒 Waker| A\n    A --&gt;|无就绪任务| G[WFI 低功耗休眠]\n    H[static 分配] --&gt; B\n    H --&gt; C\n    H --&gt; D</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>Embassy (async)</th>\n<th>传统 RTOS (FreeRTOS)</th>\n<th>裸机超级循环</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>并发模型</td>\n<td>协作式状态机</td>\n<td>抢占式任务切换</td>\n<td>轮询 + 中断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存分配</td>\n<td>编译期静态</td>\n<td>每任务独立栈(通常512B-4KB)</td>\n<td>静态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文切换</td>\n<td>无（同一栈）</td>\n<td>硬件保存/恢复寄存器</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低功耗支持</td>\n<td>自动 WFI</td>\n<td>需手动 idle hook</td>\n<td>需手动实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先级</td>\n<td>多执行器分优先级</td>\n<td>内置优先级调度</td>\n<td>中断优先级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码安全</td>\n<td>编译期内存安全</td>\n<td>无保证</td>\n<td>无保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RAM 占用 (10 任务)</td>\n<td>约 2-4KB 总计</td>\n<td>约 10-40KB (栈)</td>\n<td>取决于实现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"任务定义与静态分配\">任务定义与静态分配</h2><p>Embassy 的任务通过 <code>#[embassy_executor::task]</code> 属性宏定义。宏在编译期为每个任务生成一个静态分配的 <code>TaskStorage</code>，存储任务的状态机和元数据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#![no_std]&#10;#![no_main]&#10;&#10;use embassy_executor::Spawner;&#10;use embassy_stm32::gpio::{Level, Output, Speed};&#10;use embassy_time::Timer;&#10;use defmt::*;&#10;use {defmt_rtt as _, panic_probe as _};&#10;&#10;#[embassy_executor::task]&#10;async fn blink(mut led: Output&lt;&#39;static&gt;) {&#10;    loop {&#10;        led.set_high();&#10;        Timer::after_millis(500).await;  // await 让出控制权&#10;        led.set_low();&#10;        Timer::after_millis(500).await;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[embassy_executor::task]&#10;async fn monitor_temperature(mut adc: embassy_stm32::adc::Adc&lt;&#39;static&gt;) {&#10;    loop {&#10;        let sample = adc.read_async().await;&#10;        let temp_celsius = (sample as f32 - 760.0) / 2.5 + 25.0;&#10;        info!(&quot;温度: {:.1}°C&quot;, temp_celsius);&#10;        Timer::after_secs(1).await;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[embassy_executor::main]&#10;async fn main(spawner: Spawner) {&#10;    let p = embassy_stm32::init(Default::default());&#10;&#10;    let led = Output::new(p.PA5, Level::Low, Speed::Low);&#10;    spawner.spawn(blink(led)).unwrap();&#10;&#10;    let adc = embassy_stm32::adc::Adc::new(p.ADC1);&#10;    spawner.spawn(monitor_temperature(adc)).unwrap();&#10;&#10;    // main 本身也是一个任务，可以做其他工作或 idle&#10;    loop {&#10;        Timer::after_secs(60).await;&#10;        info!(&quot;系统运行正常&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#![no_std]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#![no_main]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use embassy_executor::Spawner;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use embassy_stm32::gpio::{Level, Output, Speed};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use embassy_time::Timer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use defmt::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use {defmt_rtt as _, panic_probe as _};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[embassy_executor::task]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn blink(mut led: Output&#x3C;'static>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        led.set_high();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Timer::after_millis(500).await;  // await 让出控制权</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        led.set_low();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Timer::after_millis(500).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[embassy_executor::task]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn monitor_temperature(mut adc: embassy_stm32::adc::Adc&#x3C;'static>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let sample = adc.read_async().await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let temp_celsius = (sample as f32 - 760.0) / 2.5 + 25.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        info!(\"温度: {:.1}°C\", temp_celsius);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Timer::after_secs(1).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[embassy_executor::main]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn main(spawner: Spawner) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let p = embassy_stm32::init(Default::default());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let led = Output::new(p.PA5, Level::Low, Speed::Low);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    spawner.spawn(blink(led)).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let adc = embassy_stm32::adc::Adc::new(p.ADC1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    spawner.spawn(monitor_temperature(adc)).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // main 本身也是一个任务，可以做其他工作或 idle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Timer::after_secs(60).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        info!(\"系统运行正常\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"中断驱动的时间管理\">中断驱动的时间管理</h2><p>Embassy 的时间系统建立在硬件定时器之上。<code>embassy-time</code> crate 提供全局可用的 <code>Instant</code>、<code>Duration</code> 和 <code>Timer</code> 类型，底层由一个硬件定时器中断驱动的时间轮管理。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use embassy_time::{Timer, Duration, Instant, with_timeout};&#10;&#10;// 精确延时——不忙等，CPU 休眠直到定时器中断&#10;Timer::after(Duration::from_millis(100)).await;&#10;&#10;// 带超时的操作&#10;match with_timeout(Duration::from_secs(5), uart.read(&amp;mut buf)).await {&#10;    Ok(Ok(n)) =&gt; info!(&quot;收到 {} 字节&quot;, n),&#10;    Ok(Err(e)) =&gt; error!(&quot;UART 错误: {:?}&quot;, e),&#10;    Err(_) =&gt; warn!(&quot;超时&quot;),&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 周期性任务——自动补偿执行时间&#10;let mut ticker = embassy_time::Ticker::every(Duration::from_hz(100));&#10;loop {&#10;    do_control_loop();&#10;    ticker.next().await;  // 精确 100Hz，不受执行时间漂移影响&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use embassy_time::{Timer, Duration, Instant, with_timeout};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 精确延时——不忙等，CPU 休眠直到定时器中断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Timer::after(Duration::from_millis(100)).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 带超时的操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>match with_timeout(Duration::from_secs(5), uart.read(&#x26;mut buf)).await {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(Ok(n)) => info!(\"收到 {} 字节\", n),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(Err(e)) => error!(\"UART 错误: {:?}\", e),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Err(_) => warn!(\"超时\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 周期性任务——自动补偿执行时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let mut ticker = embassy_time::Ticker::every(Duration::from_hz(100));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    do_control_loop();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ticker.next().await;  // 精确 100Hz，不受执行时间漂移影响</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"多优先级执行器\">多优先级执行器</h2><p>单个 Embassy 执行器内所有任务是协作式的——高优先级任务必须等低优先级任务到达 await 点才能运行。对于实时性要求，可以创建多个执行器并绑定到不同的中断优先级。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use embassy_executor::{Executor, InterruptExecutor};&#10;use embassy_stm32::interrupt;&#10;use static_cell::StaticCell;&#10;&#10;// 高优先级执行器——绑定到 SWI0 中断&#10;static HIGH_PRIO: StaticCell&lt;InterruptExecutor&gt; = StaticCell::new();&#10;&#10;#[embassy_executor::main]&#10;async fn main(spawner: Spawner) {&#10;    let p = embassy_stm32::init(Default::default());&#10;&#10;    // 创建高优先级执行器&#10;    let high_prio = HIGH_PRIO.init(InterruptExecutor::new());&#10;    let high_spawner = high_prio.start(interrupt::SWI0);&#10;&#10;    // 高优先级任务：电机控制（1kHz PID 循环）&#10;    high_spawner.spawn(motor_control()).unwrap();&#10;&#10;    // 低优先级任务：温度监控、日志上报&#10;    spawner.spawn(temperature_monitor()).unwrap();&#10;    spawner.spawn(telemetry_upload()).unwrap();&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[embassy_executor::task]&#10;async fn motor_control() {&#10;    let mut ticker = embassy_time::Ticker::every(Duration::from_hz(1000));&#10;    loop {&#10;        read_encoder_and_update_pid();&#10;        ticker.next().await;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use embassy_executor::{Executor, InterruptExecutor};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use embassy_stm32::interrupt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use static_cell::StaticCell;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 高优先级执行器——绑定到 SWI0 中断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>static HIGH_PRIO: StaticCell&#x3C;InterruptExecutor> = StaticCell::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[embassy_executor::main]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn main(spawner: Spawner) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let p = embassy_stm32::init(Default::default());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 创建高优先级执行器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let high_prio = HIGH_PRIO.init(InterruptExecutor::new());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let high_spawner = high_prio.start(interrupt::SWI0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 高优先级任务：电机控制（1kHz PID 循环）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    high_spawner.spawn(motor_control()).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 低优先级任务：温度监控、日志上报</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    spawner.spawn(temperature_monitor()).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    spawner.spawn(telemetry_upload()).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[embassy_executor::task]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn motor_control() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut ticker = embassy_time::Ticker::every(Duration::from_hz(1000));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        read_encoder_and_update_pid();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ticker.next().await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"dma-与异步外设\">DMA 与异步外设</h2><p>Embassy HAL 深度集成 DMA，使外设操作天然异步。UART 发送、SPI 传输、ADC 采样都可以在 DMA 传输期间让出 CPU 给其他任务。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use embassy_stm32::usart::{Config, Uart};&#10;use embassy_stm32::dma::NoDma;&#10;&#10;// 配置 UART with DMA&#10;let mut uart = Uart::new(&#10;    p.USART1, p.PA10, p.PA9,&#10;    irqs,&#10;    p.DMA1_CH4, p.DMA1_CH5,  // TX 和 RX DMA 通道&#10;    Config::default(),&#10;).unwrap();&#10;&#10;// 异步发送——DMA 搬运数据，CPU 执行其他任务&#10;uart.write(b&quot;Hello from Embassy!\\r\\n&quot;).await.unwrap();&#10;&#10;// 异步接收——等待指定字节数或超时&#10;let mut buf = [0u8; 64];&#10;let n = uart.read_until_idle(&amp;mut buf).await.unwrap();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use embassy_stm32::usart::{Config, Uart};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use embassy_stm32::dma::NoDma;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 配置 UART with DMA</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let mut uart = Uart::new(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    p.USART1, p.PA10, p.PA9,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    irqs,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    p.DMA1_CH4, p.DMA1_CH5,  // TX 和 RX DMA 通道</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Config::default(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 异步发送——DMA 搬运数据，CPU 执行其他任务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>uart.write(b\"Hello from Embassy!\\r\\n\").await.unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 异步接收——等待指定字节数或超时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let mut buf = [0u8; 64];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let n = uart.read_until_idle(&#x26;mut buf).await.unwrap();</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Embassy 将 async 任务编译为静态状态机，零堆分配、共享栈</li>\n<li>中断驱动的执行器自动休眠/唤醒，天然低功耗</li>\n<li>多优先级执行器通过中断抢占实现实时性</li>\n<li>DMA 集成使外设操作不阻塞 CPU</li>\n<li>2026 年 Embassy 0.6 已成为嵌入式 Rust 的事实标准</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章下一篇 <a href=\"hardware-abstraction\">硬件抽象层设计</a> 讲解 embedded-hal trait 的设计模式</li>\n<li>跨库参考：<a href=\"../../rust-language/systems-programming/embedded-and-nostd\">Rust 语言 - 嵌入式与 no_std</a> 覆盖语言层面的裸机支持</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Embassy 异步嵌入式框架","id":"embassy-异步嵌入式框架"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"任务定义与静态分配","id":"任务定义与静态分配"},{"level":2,"text":"中断驱动的时间管理","id":"中断驱动的时间管理"},{"level":2,"text":"多优先级执行器","id":"多优先级执行器"},{"level":2,"text":"DMA 与异步外设","id":"dma-与异步外设"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"no_std 环境与裸机编程模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/embedded/no-std-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"硬件抽象层与 embedded-hal 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/embedded/hardware-abstraction"}}